# This repo has no build step: .jsx/.js are transpiled in-browser by Babel and
# are not meant to be auto-formatted. This file guards against a stray prettier
# run (e.g. an editor "format on save") silently rewriting source.
#
# Critically, app.jsx contains the EDITMODE block
#   /*EDITMODE-BEGIN*/ { … TWEAK_DEFAULTS … } /*EDITMODE-END*/
# which a sibling design tool rewrites line-by-line (one key per line, double
# quoted, no trailing comma). Reformatting it — merging lines, re-quoting, or
# adding trailing commas — breaks that external writer. See CLAUDE.md › EDITMODE.
src/components/app.jsx

